docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  README.md,project,SDK compatibility floor and stricter digest behavior
body: "Scope: pm-slack digest read path only. Use SDK listAllComplete with noExtensions to avoid nested package hooks during an observational read. Dependencies: published CLI/SDK and pm-ops pinned 2026.9.29, pm-changelog 2026.9.25. Risk: runtime SDK resolution and stricter refusal change compatibility. Tests: failing custom-type and malformed-source regression, real SDK fixture trackers, existing digest and localhost webhook tests, full release check, packed npm/Bun activation. Rollout: reviewed package release only. Rollback: revert candidate commit or reinstall prior published package. No hosted data or Slack tenant data is used."
